    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40825" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισῐνής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίνομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>liable to be injured by, infested with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνισιν ἢ</span>
