				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.6.1
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>CP</u>
				4.10.3
			</span></i>(
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				Act.
			, <i>injurious</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
